.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH status 1  "status " 
.SH NAME
status \- Show the current branch\*(Aqs pull request and recent pipeline runs
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstatus\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the current branch\*(Aqs pull request and recent pipeline runs
.PP
A one\-screen answer to "where am I": the repository, the branch, the open PR whose head is this branch, and the last few pipeline runs for it. Must be run inside a git checkout.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
